{"ts": "2026-11-21T09:09:06.877905Z", "run_id": "r-20261121T0908Z-8d27", "unit": "openspec:add-visual-review", "seq": 7, "type": "task.started", "task": "1.1", "title": "1.1 Write `web/src/visual-pages.test.ts` (scenario \"The journey lists every page of every role and keeps its checks\", test-plan.md T0 to T3, rows J0 to J3; its test carries this unit's own C-id; it begins with `assert.ok(existsSync(journey))`, so on a tree without `e2e/test_m6b_ui.py` it fails by assertion) first, then write `e2e/test_m6b_ui.py` from test-plan-browser.md exactly: the constants and helpers (`VISUAL_PAGES`, `shot_name`, `Visual`, `open_visual`), `test_signed_out_pages_are_styled`, `test_alice_builds_tests_and_reads_a_flow` and `test_carol_reads_every_admin_page_and_the_narrow_menu`, each marked `@pytest.mark.milestone(\"M6b\")`, with locators by role and name and `exact=True`, `watch_csp(page)` before the first `goto`, every capture preceded by the waits of `Visual.loaded` (test-plan-browser.md), `@pytest.mark.l4` as test-plan-browser.md says, no sleep and no skipped test; implementing requirements \"The journey lists every page of every role\", \"Every page is photographed only when loaded, with a clean check\", \"Signed-out pages are styled in the shell\", \"The flow workspace is beside, complete and at most 3,000 px tall\", \"A test run from the form reaches a readable run page\", \"The lists and the home page show the finished run\", \"Carol reaches the seven admin pages and the tool server page\" and \"Below 1024 px the menu opens above the page\". `pre_satisfied`: both files are test files, so red writes them and the Node test is green when it is written (design.md, \"Test paths and the red step\"); the red step always stops on this harness question (the zero-value run varies Python files only, and the base run swaps no file, both being test files); answer it `accept`, citing the T3 mutation rows, and L4 commits the task as already satisfied. A red step cannot run `e2e/`: the criteria of the three browser tests stay out of `criteria_ids` and the verifier runs them against the offline stack, with `E2E_VISUAL_DIR` unset so the 21 files land in `.l4-out/visual/`. Run `pnpm run test web/src/visual-pages.test.ts`"}
